# AUR packages. Few enough that provision-arch.sh clones and runs makepkg
# directly — no helper is installed or needed. Review each PKGBUILD once and
# record the reviewed version here.
#
# Install paru or yay by hand if you want interactive AUR searching; do not
# build machinery around it.
#
# A line whose comment contains "(slow build)" is skipped by ERGON_SKIP_AUR=1.
# Everything else builds even then, because the difference between a package
# that is merely convenient and one the desktop does not work without is the
# whole reason that flag needs to be selective.

claude-code       # native Bun binary from downloads.claude.ai. depends=bash only,
                  # no node. Note its wrapper sets DISABLE_UPDATES=1, so hotfixes
                  # wait on the packager — the tradeoff against Anthropic's own
                  # installer, which is always current but invisible to this file.
openai-codex-bin  # static musl binary from GitHub releases
waybar-git        # NOT extra/waybar. A Lua-configured Hyprland evaluates the
                  # dispatch IPC payload as Lua, and waybar 0.15.0 sends the
                  # classic string — so `dispatch workspace 3` arrives as
                  # `return hl.dispatch(workspace 3)` and dies on a syntax
                  # error. Clicking a workspace highlights it and does nothing
                  # else; every other module works, which makes it look like a
                  # config problem rather than a protocol one.
                  # Fixed upstream in Alexays/Waybar#5013, on master, NOT in a
                  # tagged release. Drop this the moment extra/waybar is past
                  # 0.15.0 and carries that PR.

wezterm-git       # (slow build) NOT extra/wezterm. The packaged snapshot predates the fix for
                  # wezterm#8001: SendKeys terminates with CR, tmux >=3.7b reads
                  # control commands with EVBUFFER_EOL_LF, and the first keystroke
                  # into any `tmux -CC` pane freezes it permanently. Arch ships
                  # tmux 3.7. Recheck extra/wezterm only when its pkgver commit
                  # postdates 2026-08-04.
